 "x": 150, "y": 968, "width": 64, "height": 18, "strokeColor": "#60A5FA", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "server-4", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "server-4", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 53222, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 97018, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ef1c85b5df806c95", "type": "image", "x": 250, "y": 920, "width": 44, "height": 44, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "fileId": "80ad2de755faf5339dd68ac77cef9277ccff14b2", "scale": [1, 1], "status": "saved", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 51874, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 50970, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "797ce5e91e71f76b", "type": "text", "x": 240, "y": 968, "width": 64, "height": 18, "strokeColor": "#60A5FA", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "server-5", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "server-5", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 15290, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30146, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "b1cf3b2be89ce464", "type": "text", "x": 150, "y": 975, "width": 310, "height": 20, "strokeColor": "#FBBF24", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Can also target ALB!", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Can also target ALB!", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 64924, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 73591, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "42ad4baf64e767bc", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1020, "width": 1160, "height": 60, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "HOW IT WORKS: \u2460 Client connects to NLB's static IP (54.1.2.3:443)\n\u2461 NLB routes TCP/UDP packet to a healthy target \u2014 doesn't inspect content, just forwards\n\u2462 Target server sees the REAL client IP (preserved!) \u2014 unlike ALB which replaces it", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "HOW IT WORKS: \u2460 Client connects to NLB's static IP (54.1.2.3:443)\n\u2461 NLB routes TCP/UDP packet to a healthy target \u2014 doesn't inspect content, just forwards\n\u2462 Target server sees the REAL client IP (preserved!) \u2014 unlike ALB which replaces it", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 19566, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 90659, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "d258a7ab23244880", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1100, "width": 1160, "height": 20, "strokeColor": "#FBBF24", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "WHY USE NLB INSTEAD OF ALB?", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WHY USE NLB INSTEAD OF ALB?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 80949, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 45107, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "351e6578f096f3b1", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1125, "width": 1160, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 100 microsecond latency \u2014 10x faster than ALB (ALB needs to parse HTTP headers)", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 100 microsecond latency \u2014 10x faster than ALB (ALB needs to parse HTTP headers)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 46659, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 56864, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "39394bfabc9d7086", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1149, "width": 1160, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Static IP per AZ \u2014 you can whitelist these IPs in firewalls (ALB IPs change!)", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Static IP per AZ \u2014 you can whitelist these IPs in firewalls (ALB IPs change!)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 32485, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 36534, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "2c61d075f3d09e62", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1173, "width": 1160, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Millions of requests/sec \u2014 built for extreme scale (gaming, IoT, financial trading)", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Millions of requests/sec \u2014 built for extreme scale (gaming, IoT, financial trading)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 37011, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 47043, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "027ad5350209b78d", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1197, "width": 1160, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 PrivateLink support \u2014 ONLY NLB supports PrivateLink (expose your service to other VPCs)", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 PrivateLink support \u2014 ONLY NLB supports PrivateLink (expose your service to other VPCs)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 64690, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 10420, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ba05bab4ba69558b", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1221, "width": 1160, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Preserves source IP \u2014 target server sees real client IP directly (ALB uses X-Forwarded-For header)", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Preserves source IP \u2014 target server sees real client IP directly (ALB uses X-Forwarded-For header)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 93220, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 40343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "8d81ab951e587f82", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1245, "width": 1160, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 TCP/UDP/TLS \u2014 works with ANY protocol, not just HTTP (databases, MQTT, custom protocols)", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 TCP/UDP/TLS \u2014 works with ANY protocol, not just HTTP (databases, MQTT, custom protocols)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 27489, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 93107, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "9cae37cecf5d73c1", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1269, "width": 1160, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 NLB + ALB combo: NLB (static IP + PrivateLink) \u2192 ALB (path routing) \u2192 EC2 \u2014 best of both!", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 NLB + ALB combo: NLB (static IP + PrivateLink) \u2192 ALB (path routing) \u2192 EC2 \u2014 best of both!", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 57945, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 38575, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "cb3d96d55bc5b0a2", "type": "text", "x": -280, "y": 1293, "width": 1160, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Cost: $0.0225/hr ($16.20/mo) + $0.006/NLCU-hr \u2014 slightly cheaper than ALB", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Cost: $0.0225/hr ($16.20/mo) + $0.006/NLCU-hr \u2014 slightly cheaper than ALB", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 35503, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 91517, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "aac308bbc39a4f75", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2200, "y": 1065, "width": 200, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#EF4444", "backgroundColor": "#7F1D1D", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 36656, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 35136, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "27935c4e9c248d64", "type": "text", "x": 2210, "y": 1075, "wi